#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:880
msgid ""
"This is the call volume for each output. The level applies automatically "
"when a call connects and whenever the output changes during a call, and "
"slider changes are heard live. The hardware applies levels in coarse steps, "
"and the earpiece never goes fully silent. The Bluetooth level is stored for "
"upcoming routing support."
msgstr ""
"Lino ly'eddoboozi ly'okukuba essimu eri buli kifulumya. Eddaala liteekebwa "
"mu nkola lyokka nga essimu eyungibwa era buli kifulumya lwe kikyuka mu "
"kiseera ky'essimu, ate enkyukakyuka za silayida ziwulirwa amangu ago. "
"Hardware eteeka amadaala mu bigere binene, era sipiika ey'oku kutu tesirika "
"lwa ddala. Eddaala lya Bluetooth literekebwa olw'okuwagira okulagirira "
"okugenda okujja."

